{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:10:06.307Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f86fe369304587f9fe75f591ee1102616a580996a8a890801966cd90587d7e1e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"June, I've set up a weekday 17:30 'Pod end of day' job that reads only #strategic-pod and posts the day's new messages here. It isn't reliable yet, for three reasons:\n- The scheduler isn't running (the Hermes gateway is stopped), so nothing will fire until someone starts it. That means today's 17:30 note won't post on its own.\n- The job's clock is UTC, not our UTC-05:00. As set, it would fire at 17:30 UTC, and the first run shows as Mon 26 Oct. Someone needs to check and adjust the time.\n- The job delivers to local output only. I haven't confirmed it can post into this channel on its own.\n\nTo get today's note, ask me near 17:30 and I'll post it by hand.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
